{"4223300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Birds of War", "steam_appid": 4223300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shoebill just headbutted your teammate into a tree. A Crow is halfway home with your last egg, and every enemy on the map can hear you losing it over voice chat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO BIRDS OF WAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3v3v3 aerial combat. Nine birds, three nests, one goal: the team with the most eggs in their nest at the end wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO EGG LEFT BEHIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid enemy nests, extract their eggs, bring them home, and defend your own nest while everything falls apart around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY CAN HEAR YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat is active in every game. You will hear the enemy before you see them, and they will hear you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BIRD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four birds at launch, with more on the way: Crow the stealth assassin, Hummingbird the speed demon, Shoebill the tank, and Pigeon the support menace with UAV-style marking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY HIT RAGDOLLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is melee-first and physics-driven. Every elimination feels earned, and every fight feels like an all-out war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PAY TO FLEX, NOT PAY TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pay-to-win. Nothing in the shop makes your bird hit harder or fly faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE INTERNET DID THIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In late 2025, we saw a meme about a fake bird game that did not exist. HexNest Games is now building it in Unreal Engine 5 with the support of the Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in now. Watch it grow. Break it with us.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shoebill just headbutted your teammate into a tree. A Crow is halfway home with your last egg, and every enemy on the map can hear you losing it over voice chat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO BIRDS OF WAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3v3v3 aerial combat. Nine birds, three nests, one goal: the team with the most eggs in their nest at the end wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/8a68944cc064aaa67c2b4bd292cdca4c.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO EGG LEFT BEHIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid enemy nests, extract their eggs, bring them home, and defend your own nest while everything falls apart around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEY CAN HEAR YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat is active in every game. You will hear the enemy before you see them, and they will hear you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/7600ca5803f61fbf643c451973ed87a8.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BIRD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four birds at launch, with more on the way: Crow the stealth assassin, Hummingbird the speed demon, Shoebill the tank, and Pigeon the support menace with UAV-style marking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/ff87bc73df6cf744524823d44df1c762.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY HIT RAGDOLLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is melee-first and physics-driven. Every elimination feels earned, and every fight feels like an all-out war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.poster.avif?t=1788101275\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.webm?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/extras/d0024c36884e541519120ba0a7a94b7a.mp4?t=1788101275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PAY TO FLEX, NOT PAY TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero pay-to-win. Nothing in the shop makes your bird hit harder or fly faster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE INTERNET DID THIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In late 2025, we saw a meme about a fake bird game that did not exist. HexNest Games is now building it in Unreal Engine 5 with the support of the Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in now. Watch it grow. Break it with us.</p>", "short_description": "You are a bird. You have a nest. Other birds want your eggs. Birds of War is a team-based aerial PvP game. Raid nests, steal eggs, fight beak-to-beak in fast, chaotic matches built around flight and combat. Your mic is always hot. Your enemies can hear you. Plan accordingly.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223300/0701aee0f0e60e4ff1ca897a42feccab22b0cbd1/header.jpg?t=1788101275", "capsule_i